WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.567
-Enjoy yourself.
Welcome, everybody.

00:00:02.567 --> 00:00:04.634
Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:06.067
Good to see you,
good to see you.

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:07.767
Good to see you again.
-Good to see you.

00:00:07.767 --> 00:00:09.667
-Well, guys, everybody
is talking about this.

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:11.801
On Saturday,
former President Trump

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:14.934
held his first official
campaign rally in Texas.

00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:17.934
Yeah, you could tell Trump was
nervous about getting arrested,

00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:20.467
because he gave his speech
with one foot in Mexico.

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:24.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:26.467
Along with Trump,
the crowd also heard

00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:28.834
