Ted Nugent,

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:31.901
and the MyPillow guy.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.901 --> 00:00:33.868
Rudy Giuliani was watching
at home like,

00:00:33.868 --> 00:00:35.901
"Am I too crazy
or not crazy enough?"

00:00:35.901 --> 00:00:39.033
Yep, Trump,
Marjorie Taylor Greene,

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:40.667
Ted Nugent,
and the MyPillow guy.

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:42.968
Or as they're also known,
Four Loko.

00:00:42.968 --> 00:00:46.501
[ Laughter ]
That's the only group

00:00:46.501 --> 00:00:47.868
where one person steps
out of the room

00:00:47.868 --> 00:00:51.334
and the other three are like,
"Oh, boy."

00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:53.133
Yep, Trump made
a lot of headlines

00:00:53.133 --> 00:00:54.701
for his rally this weekend.

00:00:54.701 --> 00:00:56.667
Well, I guess the staff tried
to keep him on message

00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:58.300
by making him use
a teleprompter.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.868
Check out what they were showing
to keep him focused.

00:01:00.868 --> 00:01:05.234
-I gave them hundreds
and hundreds of javelins,

00:01:05.234 --> 00:01:07.934
whereas Obama
gave them pillows.

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:11.601
We must not allow them to go
through another election

00:01:11.601 --> 00:01:14.434
where they have
yet another tool.

00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:16.634
We have some great congressmen
that probably

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:18.601
they wouldn't go after,
because they're too clean.

00:01:18.601 --> 00:01:20.534
They're the cleanest people
I've ever met.

00:01:20.534 --> 00:01:23.868
Our biggest threat
are high-level politicians

00:01:23.868 --> 00:01:26.367
