in the United States government,

00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:29.901
like Mitch McConnell,
Nancy Pelosi,

00:01:29.901 --> 00:01:33.701
Schumer, Biden.

00:01:33.701 --> 00:01:35.234
They've got nothing.

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:37.667
It probably makes me
the most innocent man

00:01:37.667 --> 00:01:39.567
in the history
of our country.

00:01:39.567 --> 00:01:44.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

